brisk-menu (0.6.2+wayland1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Unofficial build from https://github.com/bobdole4prez/brisk-menu, based
    on upstream git master (0.6.2 plus later fixes and the configurable
    panel icon).
  * Add Wayland support: build the applet in-process
    (/usr/lib/<triplet>/mate-panel/libbrisk-menu-applet.so), place the menu
    with gtk-layer-shell, and add brisk-menu-toggle (D-Bus) for binding the
    hotkey in the compositor.
  * Drop debian/patches: all fixes are in the source tree.
  * Build-Depend on libgtk-layer-shell-dev; Depend on libglib2.0-bin (gdbus)
    and mate-panel (>= 1.27.0).
  * Point Maintainer, Homepage, Vcs-* and debian/upstream/metadata at the
    fork; drop debian/watch, the upstream signing key and the obsolete
    debian/copyright.in.

 -- bobdole4prez <bobdole4prez@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 13 Nov 2026 13:00:00 -0500

